buckets (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Major database migration from DuckDB to embedded PostgreSQL
  * Improved performance and SQL compatibility with PostgreSQL backend
  * Added async operations with connection pooling for better scalability
  * Enhanced error handling and graceful network failure recovery
  * Updated CLI arguments to support embedded/external PostgreSQL options
  * Comprehensive test suite improvements with network resilience
  * Breaking change: database format migration required for existing installations
  * Added migration documentation and automatic schema setup

